msgid "A send-only key can cause real delivery through email, SMS and push providers. /api/channelMessages.send requires an existing contact and encrypted endpoint, and its effect key prevents an identical retry from sending twice. /api/transactional.send still creates an email recipient contact, while cc or bcc additionally needs Contacts read and writing contact fields additionally needs Contacts write."
msgstr "仅具有发送权限的密钥就能通过邮件、短信和推送服务商产生真实投递。/api/channelMessages.send 需要已存在的联系人和已加密的端点，其幂等键可防止完全相同的重试重复发送。/api/transactional.send 仍会创建邮件收件人联系人；设置 cc 或 bcc 还需要“联系人”读取权限，写入联系人字段还需要“联系人”写入权限。"

